# Cabeçalhos HTTP — plpcjf.org (Cloudflare Pages)

Copie para `_headers` na raiz do artefato de deploy (`build/web/` inclui `web/_headers`).

## COOP / COEP (D6)

Necessários para `SharedArrayBuffer` e performance WASM do pdfrx:

```
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
```

Alternativa se recursos third-party quebrarem: `Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless`.

## Cache de assets (Fase C — WEB_PERFORMANCE_AND_LOADING.md)

Assets `.wasm`/`.js` versionados pelo Flutter service worker: cache HTTP longo (1 ano, `immutable`).
O service worker **sempre** revalida (`no-cache`) para detectar novos deploys.

Regras em `web/_headers` (espelhadas em `scripts/web_local_dev.py` para dev local):

```
/*.wasm
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/canvaskit/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/canvaskit/chromium/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/canvaskit/experimental_webparagraph/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/packages/pdfrx/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/packages/wakelock_plus/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/flutter_service_worker.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
```

`/flutter_service_worker.js` fica **por último** para prevalecer sobre `/*.js`.

Validação pós-deploy:

```bash
curl -sI https://plpcjf.org/main.dart.wasm | grep -i cache-control
curl -sI https://plpcjf.org/flutter_service_worker.js | grep -i cache-control
```

## Service worker

Ver bloco acima — `flutter_service_worker.js` com `Cache-Control: no-cache`.

## CORS (API)

O frontend em `https://plpcjf.org` consome a API em `https://plpcg.com`.
CORS está configurado no worker `workers/plpcg-catalog` (`Access-Control-Allow-Origin: https://plpcjf.org`).
